<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan's Metropolitan Bank net rises.</title>
<headline>Pakistan's Metropolitan Bank net rises.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31, 1996 (in million rupees)</p>
<p>    Income		     1,056 vs 786</p>
<p>    Profit before tax	  353 vs 250</p>
<p>    Profit after tax	   149 vs  93</p>
<p>    Dividend		  15 pct vs nil per 10-rupee share</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name is Metropolitan Bank Ltd, a private bank. The bank said it transferred 60 million rupees vs 20 million to a reserve fund and 35 million vs 25 million to a special reserve fund. Book closure March 23 to April 1. Ex-dividend date March 23.</p>
<p>($1 = 40.22 rupees)</p>
<p>-- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
